<title>UK: M.A.I.D, BT to launch information services.</title>
<headline>M.A.I.D, BT to launch information services.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British online information provider M.A.I.D Plc said on Thursday it and British Telecommunications Plc were planning to jointly launch information services on BT's new intranet service, Intranet Complete.</p>
